{"version":1,"content":"<p>沙特阿拉伯首都利雅得近期頻遭也門胡塞武裝導彈及無人機攻擊，安全局勢急劇惡化，原定下周在當地舉行的旗艦投資峰會「未來投資倡議」（FII）決定延期至明年舉行。</p><p>這對一直力推經濟多元化、銳意擺脫石油依賴並吸引外資的沙特而言是一大打擊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.643138+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:07:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:38.528519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684287+00:00","content_hash":"5fd6ea9a7db06492e3fc950cf9c3696a42162d8463150a2e4713474a7594b4a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}